.TH FCHOWNAT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fchownat \- Linux x86-64 syscall 260
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int fchownat(int directory, const char* path, uid_t owner, gid_t group, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes file ownership relative to a directory.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fchownat (2)
